als/issues/10253.\r\n\r\nRelated to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102398\r\n\r\nThis adds `animation_node_notification(path: StringName, what: int)` to `AnimationTree` as a generic signal used for node state changes during processing/playback. Notification values are defined for state machine, transition, and one shot nodes. Rather than include several screenshots and an output, I've attached a test project which automatically runs through a few operations and then quits, printing timing information for each step.\r\n\r\n[animation_signal_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18916036/animation_signal_test.zip)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","description":"","color":"ff7766","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-01-29T22:54:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T01:26:05Z","closed_at":"2025-04-08T05:17:59Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0c913810b2540b30f77f51296cc20fec9aec714c","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser